  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia Subregional Economic Cooperation: Chattogram-Dohazari Railway Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will upgrade the 41 kilometer existing track from Chattogram to Dohazari and build a new bypass line of 2.5 kilometer. The new bypass will allow direct operation from Dhaka to Cox&amp;apos;s Bazar without stopping at the Chattogram station. The upgrade will include heightening the elevation of rail track, strengthen the drainage system, computerize the blocking signaling system, and dual-gauging of the track. In addition, 30 locomotives will also be procured. under the project. This will enable a more resilient, reliable and efficient rail operation.</narrative>
  </description>
